  {"id": "M6.FRAC.ADD_SUB_LIKE.Q03", "conceptId": "M6.FRAC.ADD_SUB_LIKE", "type": "mcq", "difficulty": 2,
   "stem": {"en": "3/8 + 1/8 in its simplest form is", "te": "3/8 + 1/8 కనిష్ఠ రూపంలో"},
   "options": [
     {"id": "a", "text": {"en": "4/16", "te": "4/16"}, "isCorrect": false, "misconceptionCode": "F-ADD-DENOM"},
     {"id": "b", "text": {"en": "1/2", "te": "1/2"}, "isCorrect": true},
     {"id": "c", "text": {"en": "4/8", "te": "4/8"}, "isCorrect": false},
     {"id": "d", "text": {"en": "3/8", "te": "3/8"}, "isCorrect": false}],
   "solution": {"en": "3/8 + 1/8 = 4/8, and dividing top and bottom by 4 gives 1/2. 4/8 is right but not in simplest form.", "te": "3/8 + 1/8 = 4/8, లవ హారాలను 4 తో భాగిస్తే 1/2. 4/8 సరైనదే కానీ కనిష్ఠ రూపం కాదు."},
   "boardTags": ["NCERT", "TS_SCERT"], "reviewStatus": "draft"},
  {"id": "M6.FRAC.ADD_SUB_LIKE.Q04", "conceptId": "M6.FRAC.ADD_SUB_LIKE", "type": "numeric", "difficulty": 2,
   "stem": {"en": "Fill in the blank: 7/10 - 3/10 = ?/10", "te": "ఖాళీ నింపు: 7/10 - 3/10 = ?/10"},
   "answer": 4,
   "solution": {"en": "Subtract the tops: 7 - 3 = 4.", "te": "లవాలను తీసివేయి: 7 - 3 = 4."},
